            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked: \"Assume Virginia Supreme Court clearly said we're going to allow standing as a matter of State law\u2026 Would we then have authority to decide the overbreadth issue?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "44246b4260f92c5410baa74154122d5a6ebbc221d08c240546071f9ebb23f3ce",
