            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked: \"I think it's a mistake to put too much onto the First Amendment\u2026 it tends to trivialize the First Amendment if you put so much on it?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Rehnquist",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "44246b4260f92c5410baa74154122d5a6ebbc221d08c240546071f9ebb23f3ce",
            "evidence_ids": [
